    "body": "Note from #3746 (PR #3823): on fig8 Outside with the Arc entry, four re-entries after a pass-link lift still plunge into material, named. No air lead, helix or ramp reaches their starts clear of the cut rings. The pin `fig8_outside_offset_has_no_plunge_into_material` (`crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start.rs`) is known-fail on #3747. When the in-plane links remove those lifts, the pin goes green: remove its known-fail marker in the same PR.",
